      "note": "False positive. The target is not request input: it is the stored avatar_url from avatar history, which only the bot's service token can write (UserAvatarHistoryController#create requires require_service!). params[:user_id] only picks the row. The action also redirects only when trusted_image_url? passes (https on cdn.discordapp.com, media.discordapp.net, *.backblazeb2.com or the BACKBLAZE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL host) and streams the blob otherwise. Brakeman cannot see that guard. Covered by the 'never redirects off the trusted image hosts' spec."
